OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's next for people living near
OL,4,A'dusty' former brickworks?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living near an ash processing
OL,7,Ffacility have been plagued by dust,
OL,8,Fnoise and bad smells, a report has
OL,9,Ffound.
OL,11,FIt emerged after Cambridgeshire County
OL,12,FCouncil studied what life was like for
OL,13,Fpeople whose homes were within 1km (0.6
OL,14,Fmiles) of Saxon Pit in Whittlesey.
OL,16,FOne local told the BBC of his fear that
OL,17,Fpotentially poisonous material was
OL,18,Fbeing released into the environment.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
